sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pengguna
    participant S as SSO
    participant W as E-Learning FE
    participant A as E-Learning API
    participant D as E-Learning DB

    U->>W: Buka E-Learning
    W->>S: Authorization Code + PKCE
    S-->>W: Redirect dengan authorization code
    W->>A: Tukar code / kirim access token
    A->>S: Validasi issuer, audience, expiry, subject
    A->>D: Upsert IdentityRef minimum
    A-->>W: Session E-Learning
    W-->>U: Dashboard sesuai policy class
